    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαρχ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beginning,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ τῆς ἐπιστήμης ὑπαρχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					247b29
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλως μηδεμίαν ὑπαρχὰν ἔχοντος
				ὀπτίλλου, ἀλλ᾽ ἢ χώραμ μόνον</span> not a
			<i>vestige</i> of an eye, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				42
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				121.75
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> very freq. in the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὑπαρχῆς,</span> from or in <i>the
				beginning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1293a2
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐξ ὑ. γένεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					590a21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>afresh, anew,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὑ. αὖθις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					132
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν ὥσπερ ἐξ ὑ. ἐπανίωμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					412a4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν οὖν οἷον ἐξ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1355b24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάλιν ἐξ ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					685b29
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				40.16
			</span></i>.</div>
